Eze 36:1 , The land of Israel is comforted, both by destruction of the heathen, who spitefully used it
Eze 36:8 , and by the blessings of God promised unto it;
Eze 36:16 , Israel was rejected for their sin
Eze 36:21 . and shall be restored without their desert;
Eze 36:25 , The blessings of Christ's kingdom.
